      "value": "This so much. As an aspiring world creator, it's really discouraging seeing so much AI generated content flood the new world tabs.\n\nI also love world hopping and taking pictures but it's made me more hesitant knowing that I might unknowingly promote AI content.",
      "viewerReactions": null,
      "voteID": null
    }
